  "worked_solution": "Since the sum of the measures of the interior angles of a triangle is ${180}^{∘}$, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{74}^{∘}+(3x+{2}^{∘})+(4x-{1}^{∘}) & ={180}^{∘} \\\\ {75}^{∘}+7x & ={180}^{∘} \\\\ 7x & ={105}^{∘} \\\\ x & ={15}^{∘}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\nm∠B=3x+{2}^{∘}=3({15}^{∘})+{2}^{∘}={47}^{∘}.\n$$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
